---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AgnoArchitectureInfographic from '../../../components/mdx/AgnoArchitectureInfographic.astro';
import AgnoSourceExecutionLab from '../../../components/mdx/AgnoSourceExecutionLab.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Agno AgentOS Architecture Lab — Interactive Execution and Relationships" description="Explore Agno AgentOS architecture by component, execution scenario, protocol, state ownership, and pinned code references.">
  <main class="agno-lab">
    <nav class="agno-lab-nav" aria-label="Lab navigation">
      <a href="/en/blog/agno-agentos-distributed-systems-data-architecture/">← Deep dive article</a>
      <a href="/en/labs/deerflow-source-atlas/">Compare DeerFlow Source Atlas ↗</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="agno-lab-intro">
      <p>AGNO / AGENTOS · ENGINEERING EXPLORER</p>
      <h1>See the architecture. Follow the execution.</h1>
      <p>Start with <b>Direct answer</b> to see a numbered request journey: <b>FROM → protocol/action → TO</b>. Move through the steps or press <b>Play walkthrough</b>. Only the active relationship is emphasized on the architecture map. Use <b>Full screen</b> to inspect components without page distractions, or <b>Present</b> for keyboard-navigable architecture scenes. Source links and failure caveats remain available below.</p>
    </div>
    <AgnoArchitectureInfographic />
    <section class="agno-lab-detail">
      <p>CODE-LEVEL EXPLORATION</p>
      <h2>From a component to its implementation</h2>
      <p>The map above models logical dependencies. This linked source explorer follows verified Agno entry points for inline execution, durable workers, and recovery. The walkthroughs are explanatory, not live telemetry or a generated Python AST.</p>
      <AgnoSourceExecutionLab />
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.agno-lab{width:min(1240px,calc(100vw - 28px));margin:0 auto;padding:32px 0 80px}
.agno-lab-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;font-size:.84rem;margin-bottom:34px}
.agno-lab-nav a{color:var(--color-accent,#4bd1b6);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.agno-lab-intro{max-width:850px;margin:0 auto 24px;text-align:center}
.agno-lab-intro>p:first-child,.agno-lab-detail>p:first-child{font:.68rem ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--color-accent,#4bd1b6)}
.agno-lab-intro h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.1rem);line-height:1.15;margin:8px 0 16px}
.agno-lab-intro>p:last-child,.agno-lab-detail>p:last-of-type{font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.7;opacity:.78}
.agno-lab-detail{margin-top:58px}.agno-lab-detail h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.2rem);margin:10px 0}
.agno-lab-detail>p:last-of-type{max-width:780px}
</style>
